the Wizard), but not demons (of any type), jellies/slimes/oozes/molds,
elementals, vorticies, eyes/spheres, angels, golems, and maybe others
(rust monsters? grid bugs [like anyone would zap a grid bug with a
WOD]?  Xorn?)

